WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.693
Gasser was sad.

2
00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:17.054
"Don't be sad," Poppy said.

3
00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:26.207
"We can fix everything," Dipper said.

4
00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:37.024
"I'll help," Carlin said.

5
00:00:37.025 --> 00:00:41.390
"Jeb, I have an idea," Eddy said.

6
00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:45.515
"Follow me."

7
00:00:45.516 --> 00:00:49.274
Eddy and Jeb went to the dirt pile.

8
00:00:49.275 --> 00:00:51.987
Everyone else got to work.

9
00:00:51.988 --> 00:00:57.736
Dipper planted new flowers.

10
00:00:57.737 --> 00:01:02.677
Carlin fixed the sign.

11
00:01:02.678 --> 00:01:07.186
Gasser stood the fountain back up.

12
00:01:07.187 --> 00:01:14.036
Poppy cleaned up the broken statue.

13
00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:22.286
Soon the garden looked nice again.

14
00:01:22.287 --> 00:01:25.758
Gasser smiled.

15
00:01:25.759 --> 00:01:28.727
Eddy came back.

16
00:01:28.728 --> 00:01:31.426
"Hey, everyone," he said.

17
00:01:31.427 --> 00:01:35.564
"Jeb and I have a surprise!"

18
00:01:35.565 --> 00:01:40.629
Eddy led everyone to the dirt.

19
00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:43.005
The pile was gone.

20
00:01:43.006 --> 00:01:46.618
Now there was a dirt track.

21
00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:50.011
"That looks fun!" Carlin said.

22
00:01:50.012 --> 00:01:56.605
"It sure does!" Grandma said.

23
00:01:56.606 --> 00:02:17.011
Everyone drove on the track.

24
00:02:17.012 --> 00:02:19.860
Grandma jumped a ramp.

25
00:02:19.861 --> 00:02:23.071
"Whee!"

